{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist Shopify footer section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: The uploaded screenshot is the exact visual reference. Do not redesign, reinterpret, or introduce a different footer layout. Reproduce the same dark olive background, four-column structure, typography, spacing, social icons, payment badges and bottom legal navigation.
    
    1. OVERALL FOOTER DESIGN
    
    Full-width Shopify footer.
    
    Background colour: dark olive charcoal (#383F2A).
    
    Text colour: warm cream (#E8E5D6).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 55px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 55px 55px 25px.
    
    Four-column desktop layout.
    
    Premium, minimal, editorial babywear aesthetic.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    No gradients.
    
    No prominent shadows.
    
    No unnecessary decorative elements.
    
    2. DESKTOP FOUR-COLUMN LAYOUT
    
    Create exactly four columns with the following approximate proportions:
    
    Column 1 – Brand information: 30%.
    
    Column 2 – Shop navigation: 18%.
    
    Column 3 – Explore navigation: 18%.
    
    Column 4 – Get in touch: 34%.
    
    Column alignment:
    
    All columns aligned to the top.
    
    Consistent horizontal spacing.
    
    Left-aligned text.
    
    Vertically balanced content.
    
    Keep the footer compact, just like the reference.
    
    3. COLUMN 1 – BRAND INFORMATION
    
    Brand heading:
    
    "Kiss and Kry"
    
    Font: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Size: 21px.
    
    Colour: #F5F3E7.
    
    Margin-bottom: 12px.
    
    Brand description:
    
    "Born from bamboo. Made for baby. Ultra soft, naturally breathable essentials for every kiss and every cry."
    
    Font: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Line height: 1.6.
    
    Colour: muted cream (#C7C8B8).
    
    Maximum width: 240px.
    
    SOCIAL MEDIA ICONS
    
    Below the description, display four circular social media icons in one horizontal row.
    
    Instagram
    
    Facebook
    
    YouTube
    
    Pinterest
    
    Design:
    
    Circle size: 32px.
    
    Transparent background.
    
    Thin olive-grey border (#727861).
    
    Icon colour: muted cream (#D7D8C9).
    
    Gap: 9px.
    
    Minimal outline appearance.
    
    No filled backgrounds.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Instagram: configurable Instagram profile URL.
    
    Facebook: configurable Facebook URL.
    
    YouTube: configurable YouTube channel URL.
    
    Pinterest: configurable Pinterest URL.
    
    Open external links in a new tab.
    
    Use inline SVG icons or a lightweight icon library.
    
    4. COLUMN 2 – SHOP NAVIGATION
    
    Heading:
    
    "SHOP"
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: mustard yellow (#DDAA32).
    
    Margin-bottom: 15px.
    
    Navigation links:
    
    Bodysuits
    
    Footies
    
    Rompers
    
    Crib sheets
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    11px.
    
    Colour: #C7C8B8.
    
    Line height: 2.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    No bullet points.
    
    No underlines by default.
    
    Subtle cream hover colour.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Each link must have an editable Shopify navigation URL.
    
    Links should point to the corresponding product collections.
    
    5. COLUMN 3 – EXPLORE NAVIGATION
    
    Heading:
    
    "EXPLORE"
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: mustard yellow (#DDAA32).
    
    Margin-bottom: 15px.
    
    Navigation links:
    
    Why bamboo
    
    Our story
    
    Reviews
    
    Care guide
    
    FAQ
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    11px.
    
    Colour: #C7C8B8.
    
    Line height: 2.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    No bullet points.
    
    Subtle hover transition.
    
    Functionality:
    
    All links must be clickable.
    
    Allow editable destination URLs through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    Link to the corresponding website pages or page sections.
    
    6. COLUMN 4 – GET IN TOUCH
    
    Heading:
    
    "GET IN TOUCH"
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: mustard yellow (#DDAA32).
    
    Margin-bottom: 15px.
    
    Create three contact rows with small icons., Contact 1
    
    Icon: WhatsApp outline icon.
    
    Text:
    "Chat on WhatsApp"
    
    Font: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Colour: #C7C8B8.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Editable WhatsApp phone number.
    
    Link to WhatsApp using a wa.me URL.
    
    Open in a new tab.
    
    Contact 2
    
    Icon: Envelope outline icon.
    
    Text:
    "Send us an email"
    
    Functionality:
    
    Editable customer support email.
    
    Use mailto link.
    
    Contact 3
    
    Icon: Instagram outline icon.
    
    Text:
    "@kissandkry"
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the official Instagram profile.
    
    Open in a new tab.
    
    Contact styling:
    
    Icon size: 13px.
    
    Icon colour: mustard yellow (#DDAA32).
    
    Text colour: #C7C8B8.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Vertical spacing: 12px.
    
    Align icons and text horizontally.
    
    7. FOOTER DIVIDER
    
    Below all four columns, create a thin horizontal divider.
    
    Width: 100%.
    
    Height: 1px.
    
    Colour: #4C533B.
    
    Opacity: 70%.
    
    Margin-top: 45px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 20px.
    
    The divider should span the full content width.
    
    8. BOTTOM FOOTER BAR
    
    Create a single horizontal row divided into three sections.
    
    LEFT – COPYRIGHT
    
    Text:
    
    "© 2026 Kiss and Kry. All rights reserved."
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #AEB09D.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    CENTRE – PAYMENT METHOD BADGES
    
    Display five small payment badges horizontally.
    
    Badges:
    
    UPI
    
    VISA
    
    MASTERCARD
    
    RUPAY
    
    COD
    
    Design:
    
    Small rounded rectangular badges.
    
    Background: #4A503B.
    
    Text/icon colour: #E1E1D5.
    
    Height: 25px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 10px.
    
    Border radius: 6px.
    
    Gap: 6px.
    
    Font: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Size: 8px.
    
    Use appropriate payment logos where available.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Only display payment methods supported by the store. Make the payment badges configurable.
    
    RIGHT – LEGAL LINKS
    
    Display three links in one horizontal row:
    
    Privacy policy
    
    Terms of service
    
    Refund policy
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #AEB09D.
    
    Horizontal spacing: 18px.
    
    No underlines by default.
    
    Subtle hover colour: #F5F3E7.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the corresponding Shopify policy pages.
    
    Use Shopify's native policy URLs where available.
    
    9. EXACT COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use these colours throughout:
    
    Footer background: #383F2A
    
    Primary heading: #F5F3E7
    
    Secondary text: #C7C8B8
    
    Muted text: #AEB09D
    
    Accent yellow: #DDAA32
    
    Social icon border: #727861
    
    Divider: #4C533B
    
    Payment badge background: #4A503B
    
    10. TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Use Montserrat exclusively.
    
    Brand name: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Column headings: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Navigation links: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Description: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Contact information: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Copyright: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Payment badges: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Maintain a clean and premium typography hierarchy., 11. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop
    
    Four columns in one horizontal row.
    
    Brand information on the left.
    
    Shop and Explore in the centre.
    
    Contact information on the right.
    
    Divider below all columns.
    
    Three-part bottom footer row.
    
    Tablet
    
    Maintain four columns where possible.
    
    Reduce column spacing.
    
    Reduce horizontal padding proportionally.
    
    Allow the bottom row to wrap if required.
    
    Mobile
    
    Use a two-column grid for footer navigation.
    
    Brand information should occupy the full width at the top.
    
    Social media icons underneath the description.
    
    Shop and Explore displayed side by side.
    
    Contact information below navigation.
    
    Bottom divider across the full width.
    
    Copyright, payment badges and legal links stacked vertically and centred.
    
    Allow legal links to wrap.
    
    Use 22px horizontal padding.
    
    Keep typography readable.
    
    Prevent horizontal overflow.
    
    12. SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR FUNCTIONALITY
    
    Generate a complete, self-contained Shopify Liquid footer section.
    
    Include editable settings for:
    
    Brand information
    
    Brand name.
    
    Brand description.
    
    Brand logo (optional).
    
    Social media
    
    Instagram URL.
    
    Facebook URL.
    
    YouTube URL.
    
    Pinterest URL.
    
    Shop navigation
    
    Navigation heading.
    
    Collection links.
    
    Individual link destinations.
    
    Explore navigation
    
    Navigation heading.
    
    Page links.
    
    Individual link destinations.
    
    Contact information
    
    WhatsApp number.
    
    Support email.
    
    Instagram username and URL.
    
    Payment methods
    
    Enable/disable individual payment badges.
    
    Show/hide payment row.
    
    Legal navigation
    
    Privacy policy.
    
    Terms of service.
    
    Refund policy.
    
    Design settings
    
    Background colour.
    
    Text colour.
    
    Heading colour.
    
    Accent colour.
    
    Divider colour.
    
    Section padding.
    
    Column spacing.
    
    Typography sizes.
    
    Social icon sizes.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}{% assign wa = block.settings.whatsapp_phone | remove: '+' | remove: ' ' | remove: '-' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' %}{% style %}.kry-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-family:Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif}.kry-{{ ai_gen_id }} *{box-sizing:border-box}.kry-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}{max-width:1310px;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;margin:auto;padding:{{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 55px 25px}.kry-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:grid;grid-template-columns:30fr 18fr 18fr 34fr;gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;align-items:start}.kry-brand-{{ ai_gen_id }}{max-width:290px}.kry-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:{{ block.settings.logo_width }}px;height:auto;margin-bottom:12px}.kry-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}{font-size:{{ block.settings.brand_size }}px;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px}.kry-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }}{font-size:{{ block.settings.body_size }}px;line-height:1.6;max-width:240px;margin:0}.kry-socials-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;gap:9px;margin-top:20px}.kry-social-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:{{ block.settings.social_size }}px;height:{{ block.settings.social_size }}px;border:1px solid #727861;border-radius:50%;color:#D7D8C9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.kry-social-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg{width:15px;height:15px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5}.kry-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}{color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;margin:2px 0 15px}.kry-links-{{ ai_gen_id }}{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.kry-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a,.kry-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }} a{color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:{{ block.settings.body_size }}px;text-decoration:none;line-height:2}.kry-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover,.kry-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover{color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}}.kry-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.kry-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }} a{line-height:1.6}.kry-contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.kry-contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg{width:13px;height:13px;stroke:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};fill:none;stroke-width:1.6}.kry-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}{height:1px;background:{{ block.settings.divider_color }};opacity:.7;margin:45px 0 20px}.kry-bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;gap:20px}.kry-copy-{{ ai_gen_id }},.kry-legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} a{font-size:9px;color:#AEB09D;margin:0}.kry-payments-{{ ai_gen_id }},.kry-legal-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.kry-payments-{{ ai_gen_id }}{justify-content:center}.kry-payments-{{ ai_gen_id }} li{background:#4A503B;border-radius:6px;height:25px;min-width:40px;padding:0 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#E1E1D5}.kry-payments-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg{height:15px;width:auto;max-width:48px;fill:#E1E1D5}.kry-legal-{{ ai_gen_id }}{justify-content:flex-end;gap:18px}.kry-legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} a{text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.kry-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }};outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:1000px){.kry-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding-left:32px;padding-right:32px}.kry-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}{gap:20px}}@media(max-width:749px){.kry-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:100%;padding:40px 22px 22px}.kry-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px 20px}.kry-brand-{{ ai_gen_id }},.kry-contact-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}{grid-column:1/-1}.kry-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}{margin:32px 0 18px}.kry-bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:14px}.kry-payments-{{ ai_gen_id }},.kry-legal-{{ ai_gen_id }}{justify-content:center}.kry-legal-{{ ai_gen_id }}{gap:8px 18px}}{% endstyle %}<footer class="kry-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="kry-inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><div class="kry-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><div class="kry-brand-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% if block.settings.logo %}<img class="kry-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}" src="{{ block.settings.logo | image_url: width: 500 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.brand_name | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}<h2 class="kry-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.brand_name | escape }}</h2><p class="kry-desc-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description | escape }}</p><div class="kry-socials-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% assign social_names='instagram,facebook,youtube,pinterest' | split: ',' %}{% for social in social_names %}{% assign setting_id=social | append:'_url' %}{% if block.settings[setting_id] != blank %}<a class="kry-social-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ block.settings[setting_id] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="{{ social | capitalize }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></div><nav aria-label="Shop"><h3 class="kry-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.shop_heading | escape }}</h3><ul class="kry-links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% for i in (1..4) %}{% assign k='shop_url_' | append:i %}{% assign t='shop_text_' | append:i %}{% if block.settings[k] != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings[k] }}">{{ block.settings[t] | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></nav><nav aria-label="Explore"><h3 class="kry-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.explore_heading | escape }}</h3><ul class="kry-links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% for i in (1..5) %}{% assign k='explore_url_' | append:i %}{% assign t='explore_text_' | append:i %}{% if block.settings[k] != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings[k] }}">{{ block.settings[t] | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></nav><div class="kry-contact-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><h3 class="kry-head-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.contact_heading | escape }}</h3><div class="kry-contact-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% if wa != blank %}<div class="kry-contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-12 7L4 20l1-4a8 8 0 1 1 15-4z"/></svg><a href="https://wa.me/{{ wa }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ block.settings.whatsapp_label | escape }}</a></div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.email != blank %}<div class="kry-contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg><a href="mailto:{{ block.settings.email | escape }}">{{ block.settings.email_label | escape }}</a></div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.contact_instagram_url != blank %}<div class="kry-contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg><a href="{{ block.settings.contact_instagram_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ block.settings.instagram_handle | escape }}</a></div>{% endif %}</div></div></div><div class="kry-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div><div class="kry-bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><p class="kry-copy-{{ ai_gen_id }}">© {{ 'now' | date:'%Y' }} {{ block.settings.brand_name | escape }}. {{ block.settings.copyright_text | escape }}</p>{% if block.settings.show_payments %}<ul class="kry-payments-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% for type in shop.enabled_payment_types %}{% assign enabled=true %}{% if type == 'visa' and block.settings.show_visa == false %}{% assign enabled=false %}{% endif %}{% if type == 'master' and block.settings.show_mastercard == false %}{% assign enabled=false %}{% endif %}{% if type == 'paypal' and block.settings.show_paypal == false %}{% assign enabled=false %}{% endif %}{% if enabled %}<li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag }}</li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}<ul class="kry-legal-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% if block.settings.show_privacy and shop.privacy_policy %}<li><a href="{{ shop.privacy_policy.url }}">Privacy policy</a></li>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_terms and shop.terms_of_service %}<li><a href="{{ shop.terms_of_service.url }}">Terms of service</a></li>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_refund and shop.refund_policy %}<li><a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">Refund policy</a></li>{% endif %}</ul></div></div></footer>{% schema %}{"name":"Kiss and Kry footer","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"header","content":"Brand information"},{"type":"text","id":"brand_name","label":"Brand name","default":"Kiss and Kry"},{"type":"textarea","id":"description","label":"Description","default":"Born from bamboo. Made for baby. Ultra soft, naturally breathable essentials for every kiss and every cry."},{"type":"image_picker","id":"logo","label":"Brand logo"},{"type":"range","id":"logo_width","label":"Logo width","min":50,"max":250,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":120},{"type":"header","content":"Social media"},{"type":"url","id":"instagram_url","label":"Instagram URL"},{"type":"url","id":"facebook_url","label":"Facebook URL"},{"type":"url","id":"youtube_url","label":"YouTube URL"},{"type":"url","id":"pinterest_url","label":"Pinterest URL"},{"type":"header","content":"Shop navigation"},{"type":"text","id":"shop_heading","label":"Heading","default":"SHOP"},{"type":"text","id":"shop_text_1","label":"Link 1 label","default":"Bodysuits"},{"type":"url","id":"shop_url_1","label":"Link 1 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"shop_text_2","label":"Link 2 label","default":"Footies"},{"type":"url","id":"shop_url_2","label":"Link 2 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"shop_text_3","label":"Link 3 label","default":"Rompers"},{"type":"url","id":"shop_url_3","label":"Link 3 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"shop_text_4","label":"Link 4 label","default":"Crib sheets"},{"type":"url","id":"shop_url_4","label":"Link 4 destination"},{"type":"header","content":"Explore navigation"},{"type":"text","id":"explore_heading","label":"Heading","default":"EXPLORE"},{"type":"text","id":"explore_text_1","label":"Link 1 label","default":"Why bamboo"},{"type":"url","id":"explore_url_1","label":"Link 1 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"explore_text_2","label":"Link 2 label","default":"Our story"},{"type":"url","id":"explore_url_2","label":"Link 2 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"explore_text_3","label":"Link 3 label","default":"Reviews"},{"type":"url","id":"explore_url_3","label":"Link 3 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"explore_text_4","label":"Link 4 label","default":"Care guide"},{"type":"url","id":"explore_url_4","label":"Link 4 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"explore_text_5","label":"Link 5 label","default":"FAQ"},{"type":"url","id":"explore_url_5","label":"Link 5 destination"},{"type":"header","content":"Contact information"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_heading","label":"Heading","default":"GET IN TOUCH"},{"type":"text","id":"whatsapp_phone","label":"WhatsApp phone number","info":"Include country code"},{"type":"text","id":"whatsapp_label","label":"WhatsApp text","default":"Chat on WhatsApp"},{"type":"text","id":"email","label":"Support email"},{"type":"text","id":"email_label","label":"Email link text","default":"Send us an email"},{"type":"text","id":"instagram_handle","label":"Instagram username","default":"@kissandkry"},{"type":"url","id":"contact_instagram_url","label":"Contact Instagram URL"},{"type":"header","content":"Payments and legal"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_payments","label":"Show payment row","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_visa","label":"Show Visa when supported","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_mastercard","label":"Show Mastercard when supported","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_paypal","label":"Show PayPal when supported","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_privacy","label":"Show privacy policy","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_terms","label":"Show terms of service","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_refund","label":"Show refund policy","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"copyright_text","label":"Copyright text","default":"All rights reserved."},{"type":"header","content":"Design settings"},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#383F2A"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#C7C8B8"},{"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Brand heading","default":"#F5F3E7"},{"type":"color","id":"accent_color","label":"Accent","default":"#DDAA32"},{"type":"color","id":"divider_color","label":"Divider","default":"#4C533B"},{"type":"range","id":"padding_top","label":"Top padding","min":25,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":55},{"type":"range","id":"column_gap","label":"Column spacing","min":10,"max":50,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":40},{"type":"range","id":"brand_size","label":"Brand name size","min":16,"max":32,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":22},{"type":"range","id":"body_size","label":"Text size","min":10,"max":16,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":11},{"type":"range","id":"social_size","label":"Social icon size","min":24,"max":48,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":32}],"presets":[{"name":"Kiss and Kry footer"}],"tag":null,"class":"kiss-and-kry-footer-block"}{% endschema %}